            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A light emitting display apparatus (10) includes: a substrate (100) including a display area (AA); a circuit layer (101) disposed in the display area (AA); a planarization layer (103) disposed over the circuit layer (101); a dam (104) disposed over the circuit layer (101) along a periphery portion of the substrate (100); a groove line (105) disposed between a lateral surface of the planarization layer (103) and the dam (104) and surrounded by the dam (104); an undercut area (UCA) between the lateral surface of the planarization layer (103) and the circuit layer (101); and a light emitting device layer (EDL) including a self-emitting device (ED) disposed over the planarization layer (103), the dam (104), and the groove line (105), wherein the self-emitting device (ED) is disconnected at the undercut area (UCA) and the dam (104).</p>
            </abstract>
